# This install's own environment variables: the ones its code in src/custom
# reads. Core's are in the root .env.example. Real values go in .env.local
# (and the host's settings), never here.
#
# One line on what each is for, where to get it, and whether it is required:
#
# Signing secret for the CRM webhook at /api/x/crm/hook (required for the hook).
# CRM_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
